      "notes": "Replaces one declared body section (`section`/`value`) of a proposed decision (`DEC-*`) by id through validated persistence, with optional expected_source_digest stale-write protection. Identity is server-resolved. Accepted decisions refuse edits. Ratification is a human-only operator action with no MCP route: finish the proposed draft and ask the operator to ratify it.",
